      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby confirmed with the localization team that this reference to the number 9000 isn't a reference to the famous \"it's over 9000!\" Internet joke. He even included a note in the translation spreadsheet that said \"Don't localize this as an over 9000 meme. Wait, that doesn't exist in Japan, does it...?\". With this information in mind, the translator gave Mettaton's line a simple, straightforward translation into Japanese.",
